// EXPECT-WARNING: /DotBeer/equipments/0 ("Nominal Batch Too Big"): default_batch_size (58 l) plus kettle loss (3 l) plus 60 minutes' boil-off (4.5 l) needs a pre-boil volume of 65.5 l, which is more than kettle max_volume (60 l)
// EXPECT-WARNING: /DotBeer/equipments/1 ("Mixed Units Too Big"): default_batch_size (5 gal) plus kettle loss (1 l) plus 60 minutes' boil-off (4 l) needs a pre-boil volume of 23.9271 l, which is more than kettle max_volume (22 l)
// EXPECT-WARNING: /DotBeer/equipments/2 ("No Boil-Off Given"): default_batch_size (30 l) plus kettle loss (2 l) needs a pre-boil volume of 32 l, which is more than kettle max_volume (30 l)
//
// Default batch sizes that, with the kettle loss and an hour's boil-off, need more pre-boil wort than the kettle can
// hold.  This is valid (and JSON Schema cannot check it anyway), but it is probably a mistake -- eg a manufacturer's
// nominal batch size that assumes a shorter boil -- so scripts/validate.py gives a warning:
//   • all in the same units
//   • in different units
//   • with no boil-off rate given (so we only check batch size plus kettle loss)
// The last equipment record is fine: its pre-boil volume (25 + 2 + 3 = 30 l) exactly fills the kettle.
{
  "DotBeer": {
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "output_by": "DotBeer examples (hand-written)",
    "timestamp": "2026-10-28T10:00:00+01:00",
    "equipments": [
      {
        "name": "Nominal Batch Too Big",
        "local_id": "equip_nominal_batch_too_big",
        "default_batch_size": { "unit": "l", "value": 58 },
        "kettle": {
          "max_volume": { "unit": "l", "value": 60 },
          "loss": { "unit": "l", "value": 3 },
          "boil_rate_per_hour": { "unit": "l", "value": 4.5 }
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "Mixed Units Too Big",
        "local_id": "equip_mixed_units_too_big",
        "default_batch_size": { "unit": "gal", "value": 5 },
        "kettle": {
          "max_volume": { "unit": "l", "value": 22 },
          "loss": { "unit": "l", "value": 1 },
          "boil_rate_per_hour": { "unit": "l", "value": 4 }
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "No Boil-Off Given",
        "local_id": "equip_no_boil_off_given",
        "default_batch_size": { "unit": "l", "value": 30 },
        "kettle": {
          "max_volume": { "unit": "l", "value": 30 },
          "loss": { "unit": "l", "value": 2 }
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "Exactly Full",
        "local_id": "equip_exactly_full",
        "default_batch_size": { "unit": "l", "value": 25 },
        "kettle": {
          "max_volume": { "unit": "l", "value": 30 },
          "loss": { "unit": "l", "value": 2 },
          "boil_rate_per_hour": { "unit": "l", "value": 3 }
        }
      }
    ]
  }
}
